  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n{自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive verb)\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし})\n\n- {蔓延|はびこ}らない (negative)\n- {蔓延|はびこ}って (te-form)\n- {蔓延|はびこ}った (past)\n\nWRITING:\nOften written in hiragana as はびこる. The kanji {蔓延|はびこ}る uses characters meaning \"vine\" and \"extend,\" evoking the image of creeping plants.\n\nUSAGE:\nAlmost always used for negative things: weeds, diseases, corruption, bad habits, rumors, etc. Rarely used for positive phenomena.",
